"""Deterministic site-authorization and per-publication alpha bookkeeping.

Publication PDF hashes are generated into the built artifact and checksums;
ordinary publication work never rewrites the shared manifest or rights table.
``refresh`` maintains only site-wide authorization inputs and their record.
``add-publication`` creates one independently writable alpha record.
"""

